  "name": "Vision of Elapsing Eons",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A creature within 120 ft believes it's watching eons pass: INT save or it takes 10d12 Psychic damage and is Paralyzed for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns it repeats the save: a failure adds an Exhaustion level, a success ends the spell. Someone within 5 ft can take an action to shake it free (end the effect by hand).</p>",
